{"id": "bart-dbe-hauling-change", "title": "A soil test changed BART’s hauling work. The formal order came 590 days later", "seconds": 56.7, "voice": "elevenlabs:OUMCzFUTd0F4Q6lkLkco", "narrator": "Roxy", "tempo": 1.101, "made": "2026-11-26", "key": "c1d06b06b5250594", "words": 163, "beats": [{"scene": "haul", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "A BART contractor faced another 30,000 cubic yards of excavated material.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 4.77, "shot": "r0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["When", "did", "the", "hauling", "work", "change?"], "sub": "BART construction contract"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.47, 1.13, 1.45, 1.78, 2.1, 2.51, 2.87, 3.22, 3.35, 3.94]}, {"scene": "haul", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The tests showed it did not qualify as Class I or Class II material.", "t0": 4.89, "t1": 8.91, "shot": "r1", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "dbe", "kicker": "BART independent Office of the Inspector General", "text": "Soil classification", "mark": "Soil classification"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.44, 0.81, 0.94, 1.09, 1.26, 1.78, 1.94, 2.42, 2.67, 2.83, 3.15, 3.42]}, {"scene": "haul", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "An inspector had seen a subhauler moving railroad ties. The affidavit covered different material.", "t0": 9.03, "t1": 14.35, "shot": "r2", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "dbe", "kicker": "BART independent Office of the Inspector General", "text": "August 8 inspection", "mark": "August 8 inspection"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.66, 0.78, 0.96, 1.04, 1.64, 1.94, 2.41, 3.38, 3.57, 4.12, 4.43, 4.71]}, {"scene": "haul", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The scope change was approved August 24. The first item 26 services followed August 30 and 31.", "t0": 14.47, "t1": 21.32, "shot": "r3", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "relationship", "context": "Two dated events", "heading": "When the additional hauling began", "source": "dbe", "rows": [{"icon": "decision", "label": "Scope change approved", "value": "August 24"}, {"icon": "file", "label": "First item 26 services", "value": "August 30 and 31"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.48, 0.85, 0.99, 1.49, 1.83, 2.98, 3.15, 3.45, 3.72, 4.25, 4.76, 5.15, 5.51, 6.0, 6.19]}, {"scene": "haul", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Removing the two bid items reduced the participation goal by 2.3 million dollars.", "t0": 21.44, "t1": 26.11, "shot": "r4", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "dbe", "kicker": "BART independent Office of the Inspector General", "text": "Bid items and participation goal", "mark": "Bid items and participation goal"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.47, 0.58, 0.79, 1.02, 1.38, 1.74, 1.84, 2.56, 2.79, 2.94, 3.14, 3.4, 3.68, 4.06]}, {"scene": "oversight", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The board paper lists a 30 percent bid commitment for the Hayward grading work.", "t0": 26.33, "t1": 30.12, "shot": "r5", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "grading", "kicker": "Bay Area Rapid Transit", "text": "February 2022 board paper", "mark": "February 2022 board paper"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.39, 0.74, 1.0, 1.07, 1.38, 1.78, 2.0, 2.47, 2.6, 2.71, 3.09, 3.48]}, {"scene": "oversight", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The investigation lists 36.2 percent. The signed bid would help reconcile the two documents.", "t0": 30.24, "t1": 36.22, "shot": "r6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "dbe", "kicker": "BART independent Office of the Inspector General", "text": "Anonymized investigation", "mark": "Anonymized investigation"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.85, 1.11, 1.76, 2.04, 2.26, 3.22, 3.4, 3.76, 4.01, 4.18, 4.4, 4.98, 5.07, 5.27]}, {"scene": "oversight", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "After payments and work stopped, an April 2024 change order set a 20 to 24 percent participation goal.", "t0": 36.34, "t1": 42.76, "shot": "r7", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "dbe", "kicker": "BART independent Office of the Inspector General", "text": "April 2024 change order", "mark": "April 2024 change order"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.33, 0.83, 1.02, 1.28, 1.84, 2.07, 2.41, 2.69, 3.22, 3.58, 3.85, 4.02, 4.09, 4.42, 4.51, 4.99, 5.36, 6.11]}, {"scene": "oversight", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "BART approved the change but skipped the process for formally adjusting the participation goal.", "t0": 42.88, "t1": 47.51, "shot": "r8", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "dbe", "kicker": "BART independent Office of the Inspector General", "text": "Inspector General findings", "mark": "Inspector General findings"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.28, 0.66, 0.77, 1.21, 1.4, 1.72, 1.82, 2.33, 2.5, 2.9, 3.38, 3.47, 4.26]}, {"scene": "oversight", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The inspector found no clear evidence of fraud.", "t0": 47.63, "t1": 50.03, "shot": "r9", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Evidence on intent"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.57, 0.83, 1.05, 1.37, 1.82, 1.94]}, {"scene": "oversight", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]"], "text": "The bid-item values do not establish that BART lost that money.", "t0": 50.15, "t1": 53.33, "shot": "r10", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["Final payments by hauler"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.57, 1.0, 1.15, 1.32, 1.81, 1.97, 2.26, 2.6, 2.82]}, {"scene": "oversight", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 53.45, "t1": 55.82, "shot": "r11", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.37, 0.73, 0.88, 1.17, 1.26, 1.34, 1.62, 1.91]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"haul": "What the soil tests changed", "oversight": "What the investigation found"}, "look": "map", "hook": "question"}